Server

NODE_ENV=development
PORT=4000
TRUST_PROXY=false

Frontend URL

APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

PostgreSQL

DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DATABASE_NAME
DATABASE_SSL=require

Generate a unique secret for your local environment.

SESSION_SECRET=REPLACE_WITH_A_RANDOM_SECRET_OF_AT_LEAST_32_BYTES

Generate a separate 32-byte encryption key and encode it in Base64.

KEYCROVE_ENCRYPTION_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_A_BASE64_ENCODED_32_BYTE_KEY

Email configuration — fill these in when setting up email.

SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_SECURE=false
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASS=
SMTP_FROM=
